  "turns": [
    {
      "jobId": "95b4162b-435b-4433-bcfa-500c922050b1",
      "question": "Among the 500 most liquid US stocks, which 10 sessions from February 2 through February 27, 2026 had the deepest drawdowns from the session's running high, and how did each one close relative to its open?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-07T14:12:01.054055Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-07T14:12:19.447395Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "Among the 500 most liquid US stocks from February 2–27, 2026, the 10 sessions with the deepest intraday drawdowns from the session's running high were:\n\n| Rank | Asset | Session | Max Drawdown | Open-to-Close Return |\n|------|-------|---------|--------------|----------------------|\n| 1 | CORT | 2026-02-19 | −25.9% | −13.6% |\n| 2 | CHRW | 2026-02-12 | −23.7% | −14.7% |\n| 3 | CWK | 2026-02-12 | −19.4% | −12.5% |\n| 4 | BFAM | 2026-02-13 | −19.0% | −15.0% |\n| 5 | AAOI | 2026-02-04 | −18.8% | −16.9% |\n| 6 | BKSY | 2026-02-04 | −18.3% | −10.6% |\n| 7 | CC | 2026-02-20 | −18.0% | −8.6% |\n| 8 | AMPX | 2026-02-04 | −17.7% | −15.7% |\n| 9 | ARRY | 2026-02-26 | −17.4% | −6.8% |\n| 10 | CIFR | 2026-02-04 | −17.3% | −8.5% |\n\n[1]\n\n**Notes**\n- Max drawdown is the deepest peak-to-trough decline during the regular session (measured from the session's running high); values are negative fractions (e.g., −0.259 = −25.9%).\n- Open-to-close return is the session's close relative to its open; negative values mean the stock closed below its open.\n- The scan covered 500 assets and 9,500 sessions in the specified window.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Market analytics result — intraday scan — evidence `hermes-receipt:868db719baf0497f95a70bb0d58ceef25fc9fd28584cf2843c6449e0a8e067b8`",
